Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-psutil
Maintainer: Lokesh Annapurreddy <annapurreddylokesh@gmail.com>
Description: Linux system diagnostics and log analysis
